<!--
  ===== Playback configurations (16 scenarios) =====
  Empty audioFilePath or asset:// prefix → built-in source; plain paths like /data/xx.wav require system permissions.
  The last 4 entries are AAOS system usages (AAUDIO_SYSTEM_USAGE_*), requiring MODIFY_AUDIO_ROUTING privilege (priv-app deployment).
-->
<aaudioConfigs>
